<%= gettext("Verify your current email address") %>

<%= gettext("A change to your Operately email was requested. The proposed new address is %{email}.", email: @destination) %>

<%= gettext("Your verification code is %{code}. Enter it in Operately within 5 minutes.", code: @code) %>

<%= gettext("We’ll then send a separate code to the new address. Your email won’t change until both inboxes are verified.") %>

<%= gettext("If you didn’t request this change, ignore this email. Don’t share this code with anyone.") %>
